Licence notes for overchoice-review-media

1. Scripts, data and logos (CC0 1.0)

   scripts/, .github/, catalog.json, playlist.m3u, guide.xml and art/logos/ are dedicated to
   the public domain under Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal:
   https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

2. Posters (art/posters/)

   Each poster is a single frame from the film it represents, cropped and scaled.
   It is licensed under the same Creative Commons Attribution licence as that film, with the
   attribution given in README.md:

     big-buck-bunny.jpg      Big Buck Bunny (c) 2008 Blender Foundation, CC BY 3.0
     elephants-dream.jpg     Elephants Dream (c) 2006 Blender Foundation / Netherlands Media Art Institute, CC BY 2.5
     sintel.jpg              Sintel (c) 2010 Blender Foundation, CC BY 3.0
     tears-of-steel.jpg      Tears of Steel (c) 2012 Blender Foundation, CC BY 3.0
     sprite-fright.jpg       Sprite Fright (c) 2021 Blender Studio, CC BY 4.0
     caminandes.jpg          Caminandes 1: Llama Drama (c) 2013 Blender Foundation, CC BY 3.0

   Changes made: frame extracted, cropped to 2:3, scaled.

3. Films (release media-v1)

   The eight MP4 files attached to release media-v1 are copies of the Internet Archive files
   listed in README.md and in catalog.json ("source"). Each keeps the Creative Commons
   Attribution licence of its film and the attribution given in README.md:

     big-buck-bunny.mp4      Big Buck Bunny (c) 2008 Blender Foundation, CC BY 3.0
     elephants-dream.mp4     Elephants Dream (c) 2006 Blender Foundation / Netherlands Media Art Institute, CC BY 2.5
     sintel.mp4              Sintel (c) 2010 Blender Foundation, CC BY 3.0
     tears-of-steel.mp4      Tears of Steel (c) 2012 Blender Foundation, CC BY 3.0
     sprite-fright.mp4       Sprite Fright (c) 2021 Blender Studio, CC BY 4.0
     caminandes-s01e01.mp4   Caminandes 1: Llama Drama (c) 2013 Blender Foundation, CC BY 3.0
     caminandes-s01e02.mp4   Caminandes 2: Gran Dillama (c) 2013 Blender Foundation, CC BY 3.0
     caminandes-s01e03.mp4   Caminandes 3: Llamigos (c) 2016 Blender Foundation, CC BY 3.0

   Changes made: re-muxed with the index (moov atom) at the start of the file for streaming
   (ffmpeg -c copy -movflags +faststart). Audio and video are not re-encoded;
   every packet and its timestamps are unchanged.

4. Linked streams

   The live test streams listed in playlist.m3u are not part of this repository. They are
   played from their operators' hosts, under the terms of those hosts, as listed in README.md.
